Based on the provided scene images, I will identify the entities, classify the corner case, and generate RDF triples in Turtle format while adhering strictly to the provided ontology vocabulary.

### Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
```turtle
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "Soccer Ball in Street" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :StateAnomaly ;
    :hasObstacle :obstacle1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1 .

:obstacle1 a :RoadObject .

:risk1 a :DistractionRisk ;
    :description "A soccer ball rolling onto the street may distract drivers." ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.7"^^xsd:float .
```

